  "name": "Digital, Culture, Media and Sport Committee",
  "parent_committee_id": null,
  "purpose": "<p>Welcome to the cross-party Digital, Culture, Media and Sport Committee. It is our responsibility to scrutinise the work of the Department for Digital, Culture, Media and Sport and its associated public bodies, including the BBC. We examine government policy, spending and administration on behalf of the electorate and the House of Commons.</p>\r\n<p>Follow us on social media:&nbsp;<u><a href=\"https://x.com/CommonsCMS\">X</a></u>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<u><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/ukcommonscommittees/\">Instagram</a></u>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<u><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/showcase/house-of-commons-committees\">LinkedIn</a></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p>Sign up to the <a href=\"https://mailchi.mp/email/committeecorridor\">weekly cross-committee newsletter, ‘Committee Corridor’</a>.</p>",
